title trim page, quiet take (loudest peak -18 dBFS) opened in FIT (the saved scale): chip "FIT x8", the loudest peak at 90 % of the panel
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM_QUIET 0.12
env CASSETTE_DEMO_WAVE_FIT 1

wait 600
shot trim-fit
expect text "ZOOM"
expect text "SAVE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
